<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sons extends Orion offer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sons extends Orion offer.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sons of Gwalia Ltd said on Monday it has extended its takeover offer for fellow gold miner Orion Resources NL until October 7 from September 30.</p>
<p>Sons of Gwalia is offering A$1.80 per Orion share, which values the gold miner at A$130 million.</p>
<p>U.S. miner Coeur D'Alene Corp has a 19.2 percent stake in Orion. Coeur also has a 32.2 percent of Gasgoyne Gold Mines NL, which Sons of Gwaila took control of earlier this year.</p>
<p>Orion shares last traded at A$1.78 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
